OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome evening
OL,6,Fsunshine then most areas dry with some
OL,7,Fclear spells tonight.
OL,8,
OL,9,CTuesday:FA mostly dry day though cloud
OL,10,Fmay be thick enough in the morning for
OL,11,Fthe odd spot of rain. Some bright
OL,12,Fspells and some hazy sunshine breaking
OL,13,Fthrough, slightly warmer.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,16,Fvery warm period with a good deal of
OL,17,Fdry and bright weather. There will
OL,18,Falso be the chance of some showery
OL,19,Fbursts of rain which could be heavy.
